title gradient_paint diagonal pair finishes the linear-gradient family
prompt recur the autonomous loop: take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, Rye-first, green-witnessed, send each increment
think Read the road -- REMEMBER live edge, the 1024-round itinerary, the eight-season double-seat, the crypto-parity wave. Live edge is Season G open-media: gradient_paint paints a positioned gradient onto a real image along the horizontal and vertical axes.
think Lindy-first crux-first: the color-ramp-meets-pixels family had two of the four straight directions. The crux completion is the diagonal pair -- paint_gradient_diag (top-left to bottom-right) and paint_gradient_adiag (top-right to bottom-left) -- which finishes the whole linear-gradient family (the CSS linear-gradient(to bottom right, ...) shape) in one coherent, bounded rung.
think Compose not braid, unchanged: color_ramp_stops DECIDES each pixel's color, qoi owns the RGBA target, color composites src-over; this rung only ROUTES each pixel to its position, now a function of BOTH axes. A shared diag_pos(sum, den) reader maps a pixel's summed distance from the first corner to a 0..pos_max position, floor-division so the corners land exactly.
think Overflow proven bounded: sum <= den <= (qoi_max_dim-1)*2 ~= 16382, so sum*255 <= ~4.17M in u32, never wraps. Box bound-checked once up front in u64; ramp validated once before any pixel, so a refusal paints nothing (all-or-nothing).
obs Refusals by name: BadStripDims (zero dimension), StripTooSmall (single-pixel box, no diagonal direction), GradientStripOutOfBounds, and every color_ramp_stops refusal -- each having painted nothing.
obs Selftest proves it on metal: top-left is the first control and bottom-right the last byte-for-byte; two pixels on one anti-diagonal share a color and a pixel off it does not; the anti-diagonal is the main diagonal mirrored pixel by pixel; a thin 1x2 diagonal still routes its corners; a single-pixel box refuses StripTooSmall.
obs Gates: no key, no signature, no funds, no provisioning -- fully agent-doable, no custody gate reached this lap.
obs Rota lap deep-read context/SIMPLE_LOVABLE_COMPLETE.md (item 16) -- this rung is simple (one thing: diagonal gradients), lovable (finishes the family), complete (the loop closes across all four directions with refusals and round-trip).
